      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/buckhorn_new_mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Archaeological finds in Grant County reveal faunal remains and marine shells from 2000 BC to AD 1450, showing long‑term indigenous adaptation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
